00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:31.260
It's there aren't enough Democrats in the
Senate who want a 15 dollar minimum wage.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:35.070
Do you see it that way or do you think they
should have pushed the overridden the parliamentarian?

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:39.260
Yeah, no, I definitely think they should have
overridden the parliamentarian if for no other

