00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.520
So we have a record of who voted no.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:29.310
Wouldn't the override just have created the
fight, but in the end just delayed getting

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:30.650
people to cash?

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.650
What?

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.820
You know, it depends on the timing of it.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.730
Like it could have delayed it a little bit
further.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:37.650
But also it would have it really would have
shown.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.830
And again, you make a great point.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:44.230
We know the eight people who opposed it, but
then also would have been it would have been

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:49.610
a little bit more pressure because at that
point it had come down to a it came down to

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:52.960
the fifty vote versus what they needed in
terms of the 60.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:59.890
So it gives them an opportunity to it really
