00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:04.520
Right.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.660
But that's in the weeds.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.980
And again, there are a lot of people who are
just grateful to have these checks because,

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:16.360
I mean, we're we're so far into this pandemic
