00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.360
dollars an hour.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.360
A lot of people want it.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.360
We can come back to it.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.360
But absolutely.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.580
I mean, we I'm glad they got it done.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:23.580
Yeah.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:28.260
If it had not happened probably within five
to seven days of when it did, it probably

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.500
goes on a list of failures for Joe Biden.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.600
No, absolutely.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.630
Because, you know, the clock was ticking the
same, you know, my side of the equation.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.540
We were putting pressure on him from everywhere.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.540
Right.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:39.610
We want a fifteen an hour.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.250
