next time that Republicans are in control.

00:04:13.599 --> 00:04:18.780
There's the idea of reform of the filibuster,
like, for example, requiring it to be an actual

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:24.630
talking filibuster rather than popping in
and extending debate and then and then leaving.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:33.270
There's the idea of you need 40 in the chamber
to do it rather than the absence of 60 keeps

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:34.880
it going.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.720
Where are you kind of coming down on this
debate right now?

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.070
You know, I.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:44.460
For all intents and purposes, the willingness
